(7420225, 1170866, 114285, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image. I love how you flipped it upside down. I love the window reflection on his face. I love also how the branch extends from his arm on the left-hand side. I wish you made the branch extend from the right side too,  by cloning that top branch that extends upwards,  that would of been very uniformed.</td>', 'Very interesting image. I love how you flipped it upside down. I love the window reflection on his face. I love also how the branch extends from his arm on the left-hand side. I wish you made the branch extend from the right side too,  by cloning that top branch that extends upwards,  that would of been very uniformed.', '2015-12-03 20:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
