(7420331, 1170791, 123833, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1085686" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1817/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1085686.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1817/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1085686.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1817/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1085686.jpg"/></a> Agh yes I''ve seen this before. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Yes, difficult not to be cliché in Venice. Still a very beautiful place.</td>', 'Originally posted by Neat:  Agh yes I''ve seen this before.  Yes, difficult not to be cliché in Venice. Still a very beautiful place.', '2015-12-04 05:11:43.000000', NULL, 0),
