(7421628, 1170865, 114969, '<td valign="top">I usually am not fond of your images, but I really like this one. It makes me feel like an old toy in the attic, in a pleasant way.</td>', 'I usually am not fond of your images, but I really like this one. It makes me feel like an old toy in the attic, in a pleasant way.', '2015-12-10 02:34:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(7421629, 1170879, 114969, '<td valign="top">This summarizes pretty well how losing childhood can feel. I hope one can hold to his teddy bear forever, it would be sad to put old friends on the side. Thanks for this, great work.</td>', 'This summarizes pretty well how losing childhood can feel. I hope one can hold to his teddy bear forever, it would be sad to put old friends on the side. Thanks for this, great work.', '2015-12-10 02:37:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7421630, 1170866, 114969, '<td valign="top">Trees are so inspiring, but also so difficult to shoot well. Not mentioning using them in a meaningful composite. This is a very good example of such integration, and frankly, it is fascinating. One of my top picks, thanks for creating this.</td>', 'Trees are so inspiring, but also so difficult to shoot well. Not mentioning using them in a meaningful composite. This is a very good example of such integration, and frankly, it is fascinating. One of my top picks, thanks for creating this.', '2015-12-10 02:40:34.000000', NULL, 0),
